{"id":"69baa332ad522e13","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-unbounded-subset.md","title":"ZFC Unbounded Subset","display":"df-zfc-unbounded-subset — ZFC Unbounded Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-unbounded-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-unbounded-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-unbounded-subset — ZFC Unbounded Subset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-unbounded-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-unbounded-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-unbounded-subset — ZFC Unbounded Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(A,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnboundedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{UnboundedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnboundedSubset}_S(A,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land A\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in A\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnboundedSubset}_S(A,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land A\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in A\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition applies to every ordinal carrier, not only to infinite cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnboundedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnboundedSubset}_S(A,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land A\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in A\\;(\\alpha<\\beta).","display":true}],"bytes":849,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3854","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-unbounded-subset.md|58-df-zfc-unbounded-subset]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2"]}